&lt;p&gt;To make our component look modern and clean, let's add some CSS. Create a file named &lt;code&gt;src/components/SearchFeed.css&lt;/code&gt; and paste the following styles:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight css"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;.search-container&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
